[ceiling] The parallel-sided cylinder pocket keeps the roof and stop of the physically accepted wide-gap lever. The production slice carries this inner face on the accessible bed-rooted support tree recorded in lever-replica-petgf-white.support-audit.json; the support leaves through the open pocket before installation. The roof is a working capture face.
