[thin] The upper and lower attachment reliefs leave a narrow web at their local Z=-0.55/-0.56 mm junction. The web has no assigned structural role. The exact side-down mesh identified in physical-acceptance.json includes these regions and has observed fit and operation on Mark2; that observation establishes no numerical strength or endurance.
alternatives: Overlapping the relief lofts removes the web but changes the accepted attachment geometry and mesh. Retaining the identified working print preserves its acceptance scope; the web receives no load-capacity credit.
